t.We're entering Next Fest with over 5,000 Wishlists. Which has been so small feat. Thank you to everyone to has added us so far. To all the new people who will discover us during Next Fest - Thanks for giving 'More Than A Woman' a go!Roadma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T01:21:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683553","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951820-1843481262697422","game_id":"steam-4951820","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update!","summary":"Thank you - Over 2,000 Wishlists!Thank you to everyone who has played the demo and wish listed us over the last few weeks.Less than a month ago we celebrated 1,000 Wishlist's, and I'm proud to say we've more than doubled that number since.We're very excited to be moving towards our first release with such strong support.Demo Update! Some of the feedback we've had since our demo has been live, is that the early renders are a little off. We agree.Since we've started 'More Than A Woman', we've lear","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T12:51:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697422","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951820-1840944183787588","game_id":"steam-4951820","kind":"announcement","title":"Roadmap & 1,000 Wishlists!","summary":"Huge Thanks!Firstly, thank you to everyone who's wishlisted 'More Than a Woman' over the past few weeks. Hitting 1,000 wishlists over the weekend, and so soon after we announced as been really humbling.The demo is getting a lot of play as well, which we love to see. Seeing so many people resonate with the story has also been a really made all the hard work worthwhile. We really love reading what people think about it so far, whether that be on the steam forums, reddit or discord - we try to keep","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T01:10:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183787588","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951820-1840310314340429","game_id":"steam-4951820","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo out now!","summary":"Hi Everyone,We're pleased to announce our demo is now available on steam for people to enjoy as we continue to work towards the release of More Than A Woman.We hope everyone enjoys it!-Rook","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T23:39:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314340429","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4951820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:37:57Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:37:56Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4951820":"2026-10-26T15:37:57Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4951820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:37:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:37:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:37:56Z"},"5023850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:37:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:37:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:37:57Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4951820","app_id":4951820,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:10Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_succe